<title>SINGAPORE: Thakral year net up 20 pct to S$68.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Thakral year net up 20 pct to S$68.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   68.57   vs    57.22</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		    2.30   vs     2.00</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		  11.72   vs     9.78</p>
<p>    Turnover  (billions)		1.25   vs     1.19</p>
<p>    Investment income		   1.13   vs     nil</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest     5.68   vs     1.63</p>
<p>    Interest expense		   14.73   vs    15.86</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  7.59   vs     3.37</p>
<p>    Associates			   (1.70)  vs    (3.89)</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     81.59   vs    70.60</p>
<p>    Tax				    15.06   vs    12.97</p>
<p>    Minorities			    2.04   vs    (0.41)</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		    (3.42)  vs    (2.19)</p>
<p>Note - Thakral Corp Ltd is a trading-based company with interests in electronic products, property investments and retail.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
